sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant LMS as 🏫 LMS
    participant LTI as 🎓 LTI Advantage
    participant Identity as 👤 Identity Service
    participant Billing as 💳 Billing & Plans
    participant Guides as 📚 Guide Tutorials
    participant Gateway as 🌐 API Gateway
    participant User as 🧑 User

    LMS->>LTI: LTI Launch (OIDC + JWT)
    LTI->>Identity: Map LMS user → internal user
    Identity-->>LTI: User + org context
    LTI->>Billing: Verify plan & quota
    Billing-->>LTI: OK (or upgrade required)
    LTI-->>Gateway: Pass launch context
    Gateway-->>Guides: Show onboarding/tutorial
    Guides-->>User: Interactive guide shown
    Gateway-->>User: User ready for simulation
